-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.1<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 17, 2002<br/>Christmas Update 2002</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20050604051759&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Boots_of_Haste_d4312e.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  boots of haste <span class=\"p-attributes\">(speed +20)</span>.<br/>Imbuements: (Empty Slot).<br/>Classification: 2 Tier: 0.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 7.50 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>When worn, the Boots of Haste (BOH) increase movement by 20 speed points. To understand the increase, consider that a level 20 character wearing BOH, would now move as fast as a level 40 character (base speed). Check Speed Breakpoints to know when is worth to equip and use them.\n</p><p><span style=\"line-height: 20px; margin-top: 13px;\"><i> <b>See also:</b> Speed and Speed Breakpoints </i> </span>\n</p><p>They can be traded for an <a href=\"#/wiki/Enchanted%20Chicken%20Wing\">Enchanted Chicken Wing</a> at <a href=\"#/wiki/Haroun\">Haroun</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Yaman\">Yaman</a>. They are a reward from <a href=\"#/quest/the-queen-of-the-banshees-quest\">The Queen of the Banshees Quest</a>. They are required for the <a href=\"#/quest/troll-sabotage-quest\">Troll Sabotage Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Black%20Knight\">Black Knight</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Hand\">Blood Hand</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Priest\">Blood Priest</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Broken%20Shaper\">Broken Shaper</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Carnivostrich\">Carnivostrich</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Enfeebled%20Silencer\">Enfeebled Silencer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Feroxa\">Feroxa</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ferumbras\">Ferumbras</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gaz%27haragoth\">Gaz'haragoth</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Golgordan\">Golgordan</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hand%20of%20Cursed%20Fate\">Hand of Cursed Fate</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hellgorak\">Hellgorak</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hydra\">Hydra</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/King%20Zelos\">King Zelos</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Latrivan\">Latrivan</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lloyd\">Lloyd</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lokathmor\">Lokathmor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mad%20Mage\">Mad Mage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Madareth\">Madareth</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Morgaroth\">Morgaroth</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Necromancer\">Necromancer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Necropharus\">Necropharus</a></li>\n<li><a href=